[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.87]left a single note and went on their way
[00:09.61]I never got their name until the credits
[00:14.93]now it plays here every single day
[00:17.90]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:22.84]One note at a time
[00:27.50]from people passing through
[00:32.54]a name beside a line
[00:37.60]and part of it is you
[00:44.52]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
